 REPLAY_DIR.  It deliberately uses only foreground rows: background loops are a
 load generator, rather than independently comparable replay requests.
+
+The first-divergence character indices for greedy mismatches are recomputed from
+the full responses in bench/.replay/m1/outputs when present (gitignored on the
+host). When those outputs are not available in the sandbox, they are carried
+from the previously committed summary.json, which was produced from the same
+replay run, so the indices remain correct.
